{"name": "Rusty Vein", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>* This project was created as a graduation work for ChungKang College of Cultural Industries.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Metal Gauntlet of Lightning and Flame, \u201cRusty Vein\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain wears the metal gauntlet \u201cRusty Vein\u201d which attacks with powerful lightning and fire, and defeats enemies through flashy and stylish actions. <br/>Gain the upper hand in combat through precise strikes and situational judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/4192aa3bf4eb19eee0eda13c186e1f52.poster.avif?t=1772094794\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/4192aa3bf4eb19eee0eda13c186e1f52.webm?t=1772094794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/4192aa3bf4eb19eee0eda13c186e1f52.mp4?t=1772094794\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Tragedy of a Once-Peaceful Steampunk Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once a brilliant steampunk castle filled with harmony between villagers and machines, <br/>the castle was one day occupied by a mysterious doll legion and became a tragic place covered in blood and fear. <br/>Save the town\u2019s castle once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/b18ac381f3da17b03cd16d28129d96bf.poster.avif?t=1772094794\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/b18ac381f3da17b03cd16d28129d96bf.webm?t=1772094794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/b18ac381f3da17b03cd16d28129d96bf.mp4?t=1772094794\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Mysterious Girl, \u201cSafi\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mysterious girl Safi, who controls the dolls and wanders the steampunk castle, is transporting the bodies created by the battles between the legion and the town\u2019s soldiers to an unknown location\u2026<br/>What is her true identity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/7fe3fc18dde5da3e7cb3bb37e1bc1836.poster.avif?t=1772094794\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/7fe3fc18dde5da3e7cb3bb37e1bc1836.webm?t=1772094794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/extras/7fe3fc18dde5da3e7cb3bb37e1bc1836.mp4?t=1772094794\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Rusty Vein is a 2.5D action-adventure game. Wearing a metal gauntlet, Rain sets out on a journey to defeat the mysterious doll legion that has occupied the town\u2019s castle.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327130/ba2696b7ac8844d4d0fa07a4f9ef8e2ba2d85ce0/header.jpg?t=1772094794", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action-Adventure", "Action", "Side Scroller", "Adventure", "2.5D", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "\uace8\ub4e0\ud0c0\uc6b4", "publishers": "\uace8\ub4e0\ud0c0\uc6b4", "release_date": "26 Feb, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4327130", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 February 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/mLp63f2wl1M", "first_seen": 1772060400.0, "review_rank": 1225}